      "content": "Living from a place of this kind of raw honesty can indeed be liberating, as it would allow you to create without the burden of preserving it for others. Finding peace in the finality of it could be about embracing the impermanence of everything and being at one with the natural cycles of existence. This kind of acceptance can lead to a sense of liberation and freedom from the need for external validation or lasting expression.",
